{
  "name": "AeggPepp Telegram Receipt & Expense Tracker",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "telegram-trigger",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ Boolean($json.message.photo) }}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "check-is-photo",
      "name": "Has Photo?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "get",
        "fileId": "={{ $json.message.photo.slice(-1)[0].file_id }}"
      },
      "id": "download-photo",
      "name": "Download Receipt Photo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "prompt": "=Analisis struk belanja fisik Indonesia ini secara detail. Output HANYA format JSON valid tanpa backticks markdown:\n{\n  \"store\": \"Nama Toko/Merchant/Restoran\",\n  \"date\": \"YYYY-MM-DD (tanggal tertera, jika tidak ada isi hari ini)\",\n  \"category\": \"food/transport/shopping/date/bills/health/other\",\n  \"total_amount\": 0,\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Nama barang\",\n      \"quantity\": 1,\n      \"unit_price\": 0,\n      \"total_price\": 0\n    }\n  ]\n}"
      },
      "id": "gemini-ocr",
      "name": "Gemini Vision OCR",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "prompt": "=Ekstrak data pengeluaran dari pesan teks santai Indonesia berikut: \"{{ $json.message.text }}\". Contoh input: 'kopi kenangan 28rb', 'makan siang soto 35k', 'bensin 50000'. Output HANYA format JSON valid tanpa backticks:\n{\n  \"store\": \"Nama tempat/deskripsi pengeluaran\",\n  \"date\": \"YYYY-MM-DD (default hari ini)\",\n  \"category\": \"food/transport/shopping/date/bills/health/other\",\n  \"total_amount\": 0,\n  \"items\": []\n}"
      },
      "id": "gemini-text-parse",
      "name": "Gemini Text Parser",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://YOUR_AEGGPEPP_DOMAIN/api/webhooks/telegram-expense",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-webhook-secret",
              "value": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"store\": \"{{ $json.store || 'Pengeluaran Telegram' }}\",\n  \"total_amount\": {{ $json.total_amount || 0 }},\n  \"category\": \"{{ $json.category || 'other' }}\",\n  \"date\": \"{{ $json.date }}\",\n  \"items\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.items || []) }},\n  \"sender_name\": \"{{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.from.first_name }}\",\n  \"telegram_user_id\": \"{{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.from.id }}\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "post-to-app-webhook",
      "name": "Post to AeggPepp Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "=✅ *Pengeluaran Berhasil Dicatat!*\n\n🏪 *Tempat*: {{ $json.data.store }}\n💰 *Total*: Rp {{ Number($json.data.amount).toLocaleString('id-ID') }}\n📂 *Kategori*: {{ $json.data.category }}\n👤 *Pencatat*: {{ $json.data.recorded_for }}\n📅 *Tanggal*: {{ $json.data.date }}\n\nData sudah otomatis sinkron ke Dashboard AeggPepp 🚀",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "telegram-reply",
      "name": "Send Telegram Confirmation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1460,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Telegram Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Has Photo?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Has Photo?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download Receipt Photo",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Gemini Text Parser",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download Receipt Photo": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Gemini Vision OCR",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Gemini Vision OCR": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post to AeggPepp Webhook",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Gemini Text Parser": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post to AeggPepp Webhook",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Post to AeggPepp Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Telegram Confirmation",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
